{
  "id": "c1-e15-buildings-and-character",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Buildings and character",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what kind of buildings do you find most attractive?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how would you describe the architecture of your town?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think old buildings should always be preserved?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what is the most impressive building you have ever visited?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e15-a1",
            "c1-e15-a2",
            "c1-e15-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different kinds of buildings. Choose two of the pictures and say what it might be like to live or work in these buildings, and how people might feel about them.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these buildings would you most like to see in your town?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e15-b1",
            "c1-e15-b2",
            "c1-e15-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people changing the appearance of a city. Choose two of the pictures and say why the people might be doing this, and what opposition they could face.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, should old buildings be protected even if the land could be used for housing?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some factors that architects must consider when designing new buildings in a historic city, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e15-buildings-and-character",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these factors influence the design of a new building?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e15-buildings-and-character",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which should be given the highest priority?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about architecture and the character of cities.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it more important for a building to be beautiful or practical?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent do buildings influence the way people behave?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think modern architecture is too similar around the world?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Who should decide what a city looks like, local residents or professional planners?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it right to knock down old buildings in order to build new homes?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, can good design improve people's quality of life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e15-buildings-and-character/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
